Dissent/alternatives (cols 2,9,13,16): pedica = foot-shackle/fetter (restraint penalty); (13) pede carere = forfeit foot (amputation); (17,21) pede calcare/trampling or forced foot-labor. 

No prior reflection; order/grammar & "horto/fur" context debated but acrostic structure undisputed. Need to weigh sexual vs. literal horticultural penalties.}

